=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"In-game (Triggered)\" width=\"270\" height=\"436\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">50</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Resistances <sup><a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">(info)</a></sup></h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resistances\" data-item-name=\"resistances\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Piercing_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Piercing_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Necrotic_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\nAn <b>Alarm Machine</b> is a unique type of device functioning similar to a <a href=\"/wiki/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">Trap</a>, encountered in the <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Counting House\">Counting House</a> and its docks in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of the game.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Alarm Machines are  signalling mechanisms, placed in plain sight inside the guarded halls of the Counting House, as well as in several points around its <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#Counting_House_docks\" title=\"The Counting House\">docks</a>.\n</p><p>Alarm Machines look like vertical stands with three trumpets turned in different directions, with a lamp on the top of the whole construction. In an armed condition, the lamp glows yellow, while triggered it glows bright-red. Disarmed, the Alarm Machine's lamp goes out. \n</p><p>Once triggered, an Alarm Machine emits shrilling sound for three turns. This makes all guards in range approach them and become hostile to the party, and includes the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watchers</a> that patrol the dock berths. While triggered, they keep all lured guards around for their activated duration, making them leave their posts or leave patrolled routs.\n</p><p>Should the party wish to ransack the docks, if planned and conducted thoroughly, the functioning pattern of the Alarm Machines can be used to their advantage. \n</p><p>Alarming Machines are not (hidden) traps, so they are not spotted and detected as such with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Investigation_Icon.png/25px-Investigation_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Investigation_Icon.png/38px-Investigation_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Investigation_Icon.png/50px-Investigation_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Investigation_Icon.png/25px-Investigation_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Investigation_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\">Investigation</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/25px-Perception_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/38px-Perception_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/50px-Perception_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perception\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/25px-Perception_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Perception_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks. However, they can still be disarmed with the help of a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\">Trap Disarm Toolkit</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>). Also, being a constantly active means of defence, Alarming Machines are considered restricted objects, and interacting with them openly can lead to unwanted attention from nearby guards.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_the_Counting_House\">At the Counting House</span></h2>\n<p>There are five machines in and around the Counting House:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Inside the main hall on the left at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-88&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-172</span></li>\n<li>Next to the exit towards the docks at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-112&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-201</span></li>\n<li>On the eastern dock at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-103&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-213</span></li>\n<li>On the middle dock at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-127&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-232</span></li>\n<li>On the western dock at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-151&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-201</span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4577/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40752/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16708/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6536/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1126786/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.869      1 -total\n 83.71%   88.618      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 52.46%   55.543      1 Template:Infobox_